  <tbody>
    <tr><td>Daily washing causes hair fall</td><td>Washing rinses out hairs that were already shed</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Oiling regrows hair</td><td>Oil protects the shaft; it does not revive follicles</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Shaving makes hair thicker</td><td>Density and growth rate are unchanged</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Baldness comes from the mother's side</td><td>Genes from both parents contribute</td></tr>
